      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another option is not to store the time in a map, and instead just rely on handler delayed delivery.\nOn freeze, schedule a message with code EVENT_DESTROY_FROZEN_APP_SOCKETS and an Object reference to the uid to be frozen as an Integer. On unfreeze, remove messages with code EVENT_DESTROY_FROZEN_APP_SOCKETS and an object reference to the same uid integer. Then when EVENT_DESTROY_FROZEN_APP_SOCKETS arrives just kill sockets for the uid indiscriminately.",
